1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
Did you prepare well for the interview?

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:06,270
Yes, I organized my experience related to the position I applied for.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:09,420
Then, could you tell me why you applied for this position?

4
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:14,170
I applied because I want to grow in an environment where I can use my abilities.

5
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:17,520
What kind of contribution do you think you can make after joining the company?

6
00:00:17,869 --> 00:00:23,549
Based on the collaboration experience I've built so far, I want to make a real contribution to the team's performance.
